{"content_hash": "bd84e9db114392b0", "version_id": 985, "article_id": 99, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "12.5 million Americans plan to skip work for GTA 6", "title_zh": "1250万美国人打算为《GTA6》翘班", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/027/486.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1717501216174-9dc275fe680d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8bWFnfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3OTE3ODd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Doriana Popa on Unsplash", "author": "Doriana Popa", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@ibreathart?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-table-topped-with-a-cake-and-flowers-XtPq1tkY7sA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(82, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(120, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "7ee29fdf7be5"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-16", "word_count": 258, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "A new survey suggests that roughly one in twelve adult gamers in the United States intends to take paid leave or rearrange work and school commitments when GTA 6 launches on November 19.", "lead_zh": "一项新调查显示，大约每十二个美国成年玩家中就有一个打算在11月19日《GTA6》发售当天请带薪假，或者调整上班和上学安排。", "preview": "Commissioned by the tech outlet PC Mag and carried out by YouGov Plc, the poll puts the share of adult gamers planning to take paid leave — ", "preview_zh": "这项调查由科技媒体 PC Mag 委托 YouGov Plc 执行。结果显示，8% 的成年玩家计划请带薪假，或者以其他方式腾出时间，按该媒体的计算，这大约相当于 1250 万人。调查覆盖 2024 名成年人，其中 1154 人符合玩家条件，于 2026 年 10 月 23 日至 ", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 968, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 100.875, "size_bytes": 606240, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 102.0, "size_bytes": 613008, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 108.95, "size_bytes": 654624, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 95.65, "size_bytes": 574848, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 101.35, "size_bytes": 609120, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 292, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@da71318d/content/data/versions/985.json", "paragraphs": ["Commissioned by the tech outlet PC Mag and carried out by YouGov Plc, the poll puts the share of adult gamers planning to take paid leave — or otherwise clear their schedules — at 8%, which the publication calculates amounts to some 12.5 million people. The survey covered 2,024 adults, 1,154 of whom qualified as gamers, and ran online from October 23 to 27, 2026.", "Generation Z emerges as the most eager cohort, with 13% of these younger players saying they will reshuffle their diaries for the open-world title. Because GTA 6 is confined to current-generation consoles, 7% of respondents intend to upgrade their hardware specifically for this release or for comparably heavyweight launches on the horizon.", "Not everyone, however, is clearing a day in the calendar. A substantial 68% of those surveyed said they have no intention of playing the game the moment it arrives. Of the remainder, 14% expect to squeeze sessions into their ordinary free time, while 4% plan to set aside evenings and weekends for play.", "The arrangements vary in scale. Three per cent of gamers intend to request two days off or more, another 3% will take a full day, and 2% will ask for half a day or simply adjust their working hours. All figures were weighted to represent the American adult population aged 18 and over, according to PC Mag.", "The findings underline how a single entertainment release can ripple through the labour market, prompting employers to brace for absences around a date that has become a cultural event for millions."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这项调查由科技媒体 PC Mag 委托 YouGov Plc 执行。结果显示，8% 的成年玩家计划请带薪假，或者以其他方式腾出时间，按该媒体的计算，这大约相当于 1250 万人。调查覆盖 2024 名成年人，其中 1154 人符合玩家条件，于 2026 年 10 月 23 日至 27 日以线上问卷形式进行。", "Z 世代显得最为积极，13% 的年轻玩家表示会为这款开放世界大作重新安排日程。由于《GTA6》只在当前世代主机上推出，7% 的受访者打算专门为这款游戏或类似的重磅新作升级设备。", "不过，并非所有人都在日历上腾出一天。多达 68% 的受访者表示，他们根本不打算在游戏发售的第一时间上手。其余人中，14% 打算把游戏塞进日常空闲时间，4% 计划专门留出晚上和周末来玩。", "请假的方式也各不相同。3% 的玩家打算请两天或更长时间的假，另有 3% 会请一整天，还有 2% 会请半天假或干脆调整工作时间。PC Mag 表示，所有数据都经过加权处理，以代表美国 18 岁及以上成年人口。", "这些发现凸显出，一款娱乐产品的发售足以波及劳动力市场，让雇主不得不为某个日期前后的缺勤做好准备——对数百万人来说，这一天已经成为一场文化事件。"], "body": "Commissioned by the tech outlet PC Mag and carried out by YouGov Plc, the poll puts the share of adult gamers planning to take paid leave — or otherwise clear their schedules — at 8%, which the publication calculates amounts to some 12.5 million people. The survey covered 2,024 adults, 1,154 of whom qualified as gamers, and ran online from October 23 to 27, 2026.\n\nGeneration Z emerges as the most eager cohort, with 13% of these younger players saying they will reshuffle their diaries for the open-world title. Because GTA 6 is confined to current-generation consoles, 7% of respondents intend to upgrade their hardware specifically for this release or for comparably heavyweight launches on the horizon.\n\nNot everyone, however, is clearing a day in the calendar. A substantial 68% of those surveyed said they have no intention of playing the game the moment it arrives. Of the remainder, 14% expect to squeeze sessions into their ordinary free time, while 4% plan to set aside evenings and weekends for play.\n\nThe arrangements vary in scale. Three per cent of gamers intend to request two days off or more, another 3% will take a full day, and 2% will ask for half a day or simply adjust their working hours. All figures were weighted to represent the American adult population aged 18 and over, according to PC Mag.\n\nThe findings underline how a single entertainment release can ripple through the labour market, prompting employers to brace for absences around a date that has become a cultural event for millions.", "body_zh": "这项调查由科技媒体 PC Mag 委托 YouGov Plc 执行。结果显示，8% 的成年玩家计划请带薪假，或者以其他方式腾出时间，按该媒体的计算，这大约相当于 1250 万人。调查覆盖 2024 名成年人，其中 1154 人符合玩家条件，于 2026 年 10 月 23 日至 27 日以线上问卷形式进行。\n\nZ 世代显得最为积极，13% 的年轻玩家表示会为这款开放世界大作重新安排日程。由于《GTA6》只在当前世代主机上推出，7% 的受访者打算专门为这款游戏或类似的重磅新作升级设备。\n\n不过，并非所有人都在日历上腾出一天。多达 68% 的受访者表示，他们根本不打算在游戏发售的第一时间上手。其余人中，14% 打算把游戏塞进日常空闲时间，4% 计划专门留出晚上和周末来玩。\n\n请假的方式也各不相同。3% 的玩家打算请两天或更长时间的假，另有 3% 会请一整天，还有 2% 会请半天假或干脆调整工作时间。PC Mag 表示，所有数据都经过加权处理，以代表美国 18 岁及以上成年人口。\n\n这些发现凸显出，一款娱乐产品的发售足以波及劳动力市场，让雇主不得不为某个日期前后的缺勤做好准备——对数百万人来说，这一天已经成为一场文化事件。", "text": "Commissioned by the tech outlet PC Mag and carried out by YouGov Plc, the poll puts the share of adult gamers planning to take paid leave — or otherwise clear their schedules — at 8%, which the publication calculates amounts to some 12.5 million people. The survey covered 2,024 adults, 1,154 of whom qualified as gamers, and ran online from October 23 to 27, 2026. Generation Z emerges as the most eager cohort, with 13% of these younger players saying they will reshuffle their diaries for the open-world title. Because GTA 6 is confined to current-generation consoles, 7% of respondents intend to upgrade their hardware specifically for this release or for comparably heavyweight launches on the horizon. Not everyone, however, is clearing a day in the calendar. A substantial 68% of those surveyed said they have no intention of playing the game the moment it arrives. Of the remainder, 14% expect to squeeze sessions into their ordinary free time, while 4% plan to set aside evenings and weekends for play. The arrangements vary in scale. Three per cent of gamers intend to request two days off or more, another 3% will take a full day, and 2% will ask for half a day or simply adjust their working hours. All figures were weighted to represent the American adult population aged 18 and over, according to PC Mag. The findings underline how a single entertainment release can ripple through the labour market, prompting employers to brace for absences around a date that has become a cultural event for millions.", "vocab": [{"word": "commission", "pos": "verb", "zh": "委托（进行调查等）", "note": "常用于被动：be commissioned by", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cohort", "pos": "noun", "zh": "群体、一批人", "note": "调查报道中常见，指某类人群", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reshuffle", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重新安排", "note": "比 rearrange 更有画面感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "confine to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "仅限于", "note": "be confined to 表示范围受限", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "heavyweight", "pos": "adj", "zh": "重量级的、重磅的", "note": "形容产品、人物影响力大", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "on the horizon", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "即将到来的", "note": "常指未来将发生的事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "substantial", "pos": "adj", "zh": "相当大的", "note": "修饰比例、数量", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "squeeze into", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "硬塞进、挤出时间做", "note": "口语与书面皆可", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "set aside", "pos": "phrase", "